{"3694580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pure Instinct Katana", "steam_appid": 3694580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter the lands of Eternal Sun, where your blade is law and your instinct is god</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are Katana</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A lightning-wielding swordswoman and sorceress, blessed by the Lightning Lynx and cursed by bloodshed. Wanted dead by the Empress, you answer to none - your blade is law.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694580/extras/e6da830e9b69df283e9856abce4355b8.poster.avif?t=1768555167\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694580/extras/e6da830e9b69df283e9856abce4355b8.webm?t=1768555167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694580/extras/e6da830e9b69df283e9856abce4355b8.mp4?t=1768555167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Let instinct be your guide</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey of slaughter through an world packed with bloodthirsty inhabitants driven mad under the Eternal Sun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694580/extras/e84376e2fd51b996739605fca01c9165.avif?t=1768555167\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694580/extras_big/e84376e2fd51b996739605fca01c9165.avif?t=1768555167 width=800 height=258 /></span>Explore the Empress’ Domain </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where both nature and architecture grew to rival the ancient titans the size. Brave through portals to new worlds: from an icy and savage tundra, to a scorching desert where time stands still. Finding a hidden pathway could send you either to a secluded paradise in the ocean’s embrace, or trap you in an abyss of blood and chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694580/extras/b02e070f2638688e2f12daa0888cd490.avif?t=1768555167\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694580/extras_big/b02e070f2638688e2f12daa0888cd490.avif?t=1768555167 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to play endless to master</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master magic and sword in unending combos and wide arsenal of magical abilities and lethal techniques. Find your own strategy in the open world battlefield and destroy your enemies in limitless number of ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damage is directly correlated with impact, and the responses to all player input are immediate. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision and timing of player input controls allows parrying into spectacle counter, blocking with an offensive flip kick, and maximizing your damage with positioning and fluent control of Katana's blades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694580/extras/15b472fec9f0e2986289d29ce9db0e08.poster.avif?t=1768555167\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694580/extras/15b472fec9f0e2986289d29ce9db0e08.webm?t=1768555167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694580/extras/15b472fec9f0e2986289d29ce9db0e08.mp4?t=1768555167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kill the Seven Sages, Become the Master</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden bosses and overcome their unique challenges to gain mastery of their magical element and fighting style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every style unlocked offers a whole new variation of blade and magical attacks and effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock all styles, and prove yourself fit for the ultimate glory of the Master's Arena.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Technical features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Nvidia DLSS support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Nvidia image upscaling (NIS) support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Machine Learning Renderer for runtime, performance oriented, optimization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Screen based rendering and automatic texture quality control for optimal performance, high fidelity graphics and reduced machine loads. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter the lands of Eternal Sun, where your blade is law and your instinct is god</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are Katana</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A lightning-wielding swordswoman and sorceress, blessed by the Lightning Lynx and cursed by bloodshed. Wanted dead by the Empress, you answer to none - your blade is law.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694580/extras/e6da830e9b69df283e9856abce4355b8.poster.avif?t=1768555167\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694580/extras/e6da830e9b69df283e9856abce4355b8.webm?t=1768555167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694580/extras/e6da830e9b69df283e98